#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "A rider on the road"
msgstr "Seorang penunggang di jalanan"

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "Quraysh had offered a reward for each of the two travellers. Suraqah ibn Malik recounts that a man came to his gathering and said he had just seen figures near the coast. Suraqah recognised who they must be, and set out after them."
msgstr "Quraisy telah menawarkan ganjaran bagi setiap seorang daripada kedua-dua pengembara itu. Suraqah ibn Malik menceritakan bahawa seorang lelaki datang ke majlisnya dan berkata dia baru sahaja melihat kelibat orang di dekat pantai. Suraqah mengenali siapa mereka, lalu keluar mengejar mereka."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "By his own account, he came close enough to hear the Prophet ﷺ reciting. Then the forelegs of his horse sank into the ground up to the knees, and he was thrown from it."
msgstr "Menurut ceritanya sendiri, dia datang cukup dekat hingga dapat mendengar Baginda ﷺ membaca Al-Quran. Kemudian kaki depan kudanya terperosok ke dalam tanah hingga ke lutut, dan dia terjatuh daripadanya."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "He told them what Quraysh intended and offered them provisions. They took nothing from him and asked only that he keep their news hidden. At his request, ‘Amir ibn Fuhayrah wrote him a guarantee of safety on a piece of leather. Then they went on."
msgstr "Dia memberitahu mereka tentang niat Quraisy dan menawarkan bekalan kepada mereka. Mereka tidak mengambil apa-apa daripadanya dan hanya meminta agar dia merahsiakan berita tentang mereka. Atas permintaannya, ‘Amir ibn Fuhayrah menulis surat jaminan keselamatan untuknya pada sepotong kulit. Kemudian mereka meneruskan perjalanan."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "Quba: the first stop"
msgstr "Quba: hentian pertama"

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "He stayed among them for more than ten nights. There he founded the mosque that the account calls the one founded on piety, and he prayed in it."
msgstr "Baginda tinggal di kalangan mereka selama lebih sepuluh malam. Di sana Baginda mengasaskan masjid yang disebut dalam riwayat sebagai masjid yang diasaskan atas takwa, dan Baginda bersolat di dalamnya."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "Then he rode on, with people walking beside him, until his camel knelt at a place in Madinah where some of the Muslims already prayed. It was a yard for drying dates."
msgstr "Kemudian Baginda meneruskan tunggangan, dengan orang ramai berjalan di sampingnya, sehinggalah untanya berlutut di suatu tempat di Madinah di mana sebahagian umat Islam sudah pun bersolat. Tempat itu merupakan kawasan pengeringan kurma."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "Suraqah’s account records the reward offered for each of the two, and a report that figures had been seen near the coast."
msgstr "Riwayat Suraqah mencatatkan ganjaran yang ditawarkan bagi setiap seorang daripada mereka berdua, dan laporan bahawa kelibat orang telah kelihatan di dekat pantai."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "It does not establish where on the route this happened, and the scene does not place it."
msgstr "Ia tidak menetapkan di mana peristiwa ini berlaku di sepanjang laluan tersebut, dan babak ini tidak menunjukkan lokasinya."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "Suraqah describes the forelegs of his horse sinking into the ground to the knees, and being thrown."
msgstr "Suraqah menceritakan bagaimana kaki hadapan kudanya tenggelam ke dalam tanah hingga ke paras lutut, lalu dia terjatuh."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "This is his own first-person account. The scene shows the road, not the event or any person."
msgstr "Ini adalah kisah daripada sudut pandangannya sendiri. Babak ini menunjukkan jalan, bukannya peristiwa tersebut atau mana-mana individu."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "They asked only that he keep their news hidden; ‘Amir ibn Fuhayrah wrote him a guarantee of safety."
msgstr "Mereka hanya meminta agar dia merahsiakan berita tentang mereka; ‘Amir ibn Fuhayrah menulis surat jaminan keselamatan untuknya."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "The wording of the written guarantee is not given in this passage."
msgstr "Teks surat jaminan keselamatan tersebut tidak dinyatakan dalam petikan ini."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "The account gives a stay of more than ten nights among Bani ‘Amr ibn ‘Awf and the founding of a mosque there."
msgstr "Kisah ini menyebut tentang tempoh tinggal selama lebih daripada sepuluh malam dalam kalangan Bani ‘Amr ibn ‘Awf dan pengasasan sebuah masjid di sana."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "He rode on with people walking beside him until his camel knelt at the site of the mosque in Madinah."
msgstr "Baginda terus menunggang dengan orang ramai berjalan di sisinya sehinggalah unta baginda melutut di tapak masjid di Madinah."

#: src/content/first-chapter.js
#, ai
msgid "It does not establish the route taken through the town or the appearance of the place."
msgstr "Ia tidak menetapkan laluan yang dilalui di dalam kota tersebut atau rupa bentuk tempat berkenaan."

