#, ai
msgid "Leaving Makkah"
msgstr "Meninggalkan Makkah"

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "Night of 27 Safar · 12–13 September 622"
msgstr "Malam 27 Safar · 12–13 September 622"

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "The night of departure is in the accounts. Its place in the calendar is a modern reckoning."
msgstr "Malam keberangkatan ada dinyatakan dalam riwayat. Kedudukannya dalam kalendar adalah hitungan moden."

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "The nights before Friday, Saturday and Sunday"
msgstr "Malam-malam sebelum Jumaat, Sabtu dan Ahad"

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "Three nights is in al-Bukhari. Naming them after the days of the week follows a modern reckoning."
msgstr "Tiga malam ada dinyatakan dalam al-Bukhari. Menamakannya mengikut hari dalam seminggu adalah mengikut hitungan moden."

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "The guide arrives"
msgstr "Penunjuk jalan tiba"

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "Night of Monday, 1 Rabi‘ al-Awwal · 16 September 622"
msgstr "Malam Isnin, 1 Rabiulawal · 16 September 622"

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "The guide came with the two mounts after the third night, as arranged. The calendar date is a modern reckoning."
msgstr "Penunjuk jalan datang membawa dua tunggangan selepas malam ketiga, seperti yang dijanjikan. Tarikh kalendar adalah hitungan moden."

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "On the coastal road"
msgstr "Di jalan pesisir pantai"

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "About a week"
msgstr "Kira-kira seminggu"

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "The accounts give the order of what happened on the road, but no days. The pursuit and the tent of Umm Ma‘bad fall somewhere in this week."
msgstr "Riwayat-riwayat memberikan urutan peristiwa yang berlaku di jalanan, tetapi tiada hari yang dinyatakan. Peristiwa pengejaran dan khemah Umm Ma'bad berlaku dalam minggu ini."

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "Arrival at Quba"
msgstr "Ketibaan di Quba"

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "Monday · 8 Rabi‘ al-Awwal · 23 September 622"
msgstr "Isnin · 8 Rabiulawal · 23 September 622"

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "The account in al-Bukhari says it was a Monday in Rabi‘ al-Awwal. The day of the month is a modern reckoning."
msgstr "Laporan dalam al-Bukhari menyatakan ia berlaku pada hari Isnin dalam bulan Rabiulawal. Hari dalam bulan tersebut adalah berdasarkan perkiraan moden."

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "The stay at Quba"
msgstr "Tempoh menetap di Quba"

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "Four days, or more than ten nights"
msgstr "Empat hari, atau lebih daripada sepuluh malam"

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "Ibn Ishaq gives Monday to Thursday. The report in al-Bukhari says more than ten nights, and Banu ‘Amr ibn ‘Awf said eighteen. Ibn Kathir sets the reports side by side without settling it."
msgstr "Ibn Ishaq menyebut hari Isnin hingga Khamis. Laporan dalam al-Bukhari menyatakan lebih daripada sepuluh malam, manakala Banu 'Amr ibn 'Awf menyebut lapan belas malam. Ibn Kathir membentangkan laporan-laporan ini bersebelahan tanpa menetapkan mana satu yang muktamad."

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "The first Friday, and Madinah"
msgstr "Jumaat pertama, dan Madinah"

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "Friday · 12 Rabi‘ al-Awwal · 27 September 622"
msgstr "Jumaat · 12 Rabiulawal · 27 September 622"

#: src/content/timeline.js
#, ai
msgid "That it was a Friday is in the early reports. The calendar date is a modern reckoning, and it follows the four-day stay."
msgstr "Bahawa hari itu hari Jumaat ada dinyatakan dalam laporan-laporan awal. Tarikh kalendar tersebut adalah perkiraan moden, dan ia menyusul selepas tempoh menetap selama empat hari."

