msgstr "Bukti pada peta"

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
#, ai
msgid "Each point of light is a passage this chapter cites, placed where it speaks of. Select one to read it."
msgstr "Setiap titik cahaya ialah petikan yang dirujuk dalam bab ini, diletakkan di lokasi yang diperkatakan. Pilih satu untuk membacanya."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "This is the story of the Hijrah: when the Prophet Muhammad ﷺ travelled from Makkah to Madinah, a new home."
msgstr "Ini adalah kisah Hijrah: apabila Nabi Muhammad ﷺ berhijrah dari Makkah ke Madinah, sebuah tempat tinggal yang baharu."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Many Muslims had already gone ahead. His best friend, Abu Bakr, waited so that they could travel together."
msgstr "Ramai orang Islam telah pun pergi terlebih dahulu. Sahabat baik baginda, Abu Bakar, menunggu supaya mereka dapat mengembara bersama-sama."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "The Prophet ﷺ and Abu Bakr hid in a cave on Mount Thawr for three nights."
msgstr "Nabi ﷺ dan Abu Bakar bersembunyi di dalam gua di Bukit Thawr selama tiga malam."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Each night, Abu Bakr’s son ‘Abdullah came in the dark to tell them the news from Makkah."
msgstr "Setiap malam, anak lelaki Abu Bakar, 'Abdullah, datang dalam kegelapan malam untuk menyampaikan berita dari Makkah kepada mereka."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "A shepherd called ‘Amir brought his sheep close every evening, so that they had milk to drink."
msgstr "Seorang pengembala bernama 'Amir membawa kambing-kambingnya mendekati gua setiap petang, supaya mereka mendapat susu untuk diminum."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Abu Bakr was worried: if someone looked down, they would be seen! The Prophet ﷺ calmed him."
msgstr "Abu Bakar berasa bimbang: jika ada sesiapa yang memandang ke bawah, mereka pasti akan kelihatan! Nabi ﷺ menenangkan beliau."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "The Quran remembers what the Prophet ﷺ said to his friend in the cave: do not be sad, Allah is with us."
msgstr "Al-Quran merakamkan apa yang dikatakan oleh Nabi ﷺ kepada sahabatnya di dalam gua: janganlah bersedih, sesungguhnya Allah bersama kita."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Quraysh offered a big reward to catch them. A rider called Suraqah raced after them on his horse."
msgstr "Quraisy menawarkan ganjaran yang besar untuk menangkap mereka. Seorang penunggang kuda bernama Suraqah mengejar mereka dengan kudanya."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "As he came close, his horse’s legs sank into the ground, and he fell off!"
msgstr "Apabila dia semakin hampir, kaki kudanya terbenam ke dalam tanah, dan dia terjatuh!"

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Suraqah gave up the chase. They asked him only to keep their secret, and went on their way."
msgstr "Suraqah membatalkan pemburuannya. Mereka hanya meminta dia untuk merahsiakan keberadaan mereka, lalu meneruskan perjalanan."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "At last they reached Madinah! The Prophet’s camel walked through the town and knelt in an open yard."
msgstr "Akhirnya mereka tiba di Madinah! Unta Nabi berjalan melalui bandar itu dan berlutut di sebuah kawasan lapang."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "That yard became the place of his mosque, and he carried bricks to help build it."
msgstr "Kawasan lapang itu kemudiannya menjadi tapak masjid baginda, dan baginda sendiri turut mengangkat bata untuk membantu membinanya."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "One hot noon, the Prophet ﷺ came to Abu Bakr’s house with big news: it was time to go. Abu Bakr asked to come too, and he said yes."
msgstr "Pada suatu tengah hari yang panas, Nabi ﷺ datang ke rumah Abu Bakar membawa berita besar: sudah tiba masanya untuk bertolak. Abu Bakar meminta untuk ikut bersama, dan baginda mengizinkannya."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Abu Bakr took all his money for the journey. His daughter Asma put stones in its place to comfort her grandfather, who could not see."
msgstr "Abu Bakr membawa semua wangnya untuk perjalanan tersebut. Anak perempuannya, Asma, meletakkan batu-batu di tempat wang itu untuk menenangkan datuknya yang tidak dapat melihat."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Asma used her belt to tie up their food bag. People called her “the one with two belts”."
msgstr "Asma menggunakan tali pinggangnya untuk mengikat beg makanan mereka. Orang ramai menggelarnya \"wanita dengan dua tali pinggang\" (Zatun Nitaqain)."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "One report says the searchers saw a spider’s web across the cave and walked away."
msgstr "Satu riwayat menyebut bahawa para pencari melihat sarang labah-labah di pintu gua lalu mereka beredar."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Their guide knew the desert well. He led them along the coast, past many places whose names we still know."
msgstr "Penunjuk jalan mereka sangat mengenali padang pasir. Dia memimpin mereka menyusuri pantai, melewati banyak tempat yang namanya masih kita ketahui hingga hari ini."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "On the way, a friend called al-Zubayr gave them new white clothes."
msgstr "Dalam perjalanan, seorang sahabat bernama al-Zubayr memberi mereka pakaian putih yang baharu."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "On his way into Madinah, the Prophet ﷺ led Friday prayer with about a hundred people."
msgstr "Dalam perjalanannya memasuki Madinah, Nabi ﷺ mengimami solat Jumaat bersama sekitar seratus orang."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Everyone wanted the Prophet ﷺ to stay with them. He said: let the camel go, she has been told where to stop."
msgstr "Semua orang mahu Nabi ﷺ tinggal bersama mereka. Baginda bersabda: biarkan unta ini berjalan, sesungguhnya ia telah diperintahkan ke mana harus berhenti."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "He stayed in the house of Abu Ayyub until his mosque and his home were built."
msgstr "Baginda tinggal di rumah Abu Ayyub sehingga masjid dan rumah baginda siap dibina."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "He made the people who arrived and the people of Madinah brothers, to help each other."
msgstr "Baginda mempersaudarakan orang yang baru berhijrah dengan penduduk Madinah untuk saling membantu."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Many people remember a happy song sung to welcome him, but we are not sure it was sung that day."
msgstr "Ramai orang mengingati lagu gembira yang dinyanyikan untuk menyambut kedatangan baginda, tetapi kita tidak pasti sama ada ia dinyanyikan pada hari tersebut."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "The Hijrah is so central that the Islamic calendar counts its years from it."
msgstr "Hijrah adalah peristiwa yang sangat penting sehinggakan kalendar Islam mengira tahunnya bermula dari peristiwa ini."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Trust and careful planning sit side by side: the Prophet ﷺ relied on Allah and still prepared every step."
msgstr "Tawakal dan perancangan yang teliti berjalan seiring: Nabi ﷺ berserah diri kepada Allah namun tetap mempersiapkan setiap langkah."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Even with people plotting against him, he made sure their property was returned. His honesty did not depend on how he was treated."
msgstr "Walaupun ada orang yang merancang jahat terhadap baginda, baginda tetap memastikan harta benda mereka dipulangkan. Kejujuran baginda tidak bergantung pada cara baginda dilayan."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "In the most frightening moment, the lesson is calm trust: Allah is with us."
msgstr "Dalam saat yang paling menakutkan, pengajarannya adalah ketenangan dalam bertawakal: Allah bersama kita."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Choosing an unexpected route was wisdom, not doubt. Muslims are taught to trust Allah and still take sensible steps."
msgstr "Memilih laluan yang tidak dijangka adalah satu kebijaksanaan, bukannya keraguan. Umat Islam diajar untuk bertawakal kepada Allah dan dalam masa yang sama mengambil langkah yang bijak."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "A man who set out to capture them left asking for their protection. The story is full of reversals like this."
msgstr "Seorang lelaki yang keluar untuk menangkap mereka akhirnya pulang dengan meminta perlindungan daripada mereka. Kisah ini penuh dengan perubahan keadaan yang tidak disangka seperti ini."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Hospitality from strangers, and blessing in very little, run through the whole of the Prophet’s life."
msgstr "Sifat memuliakan tetamu daripada orang yang tidak dikenali, dan keberkatan dalam perkara yang sangat sedikit, mengalir di sepanjang seluruh kehidupan Nabi."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Short for “peace and blessings of Allah be upon him”, said by Muslims after the Prophet’s name."
msgstr "Singkatan bagi \"selawat dan salam Allah ke atasnya\", yang diucapkan oleh umat Islam selepas menyebut nama Nabi."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Hijrah"
msgstr "Hijrah"

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "The migration of the Prophet ﷺ and his companions from Makkah to Madinah, in 622."
msgstr "Penghijrahan Nabi ﷺ dan para sahabat baginda dari Makkah ke Madinah pada tahun 622."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Quraysh"
msgstr "Quraisy"

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "The leading tribe of Makkah. The Prophet ﷺ himself belonged to it."
msgstr "Suku kaum utama di Makkah. Nabi ﷺ sendiri tergolong dalam suku kaum ini."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "The city where the Prophet ﷺ was born, home of the Ka‘bah."
msgstr "Kota tempat kelahiran Nabi ﷺ, dan tempat terletaknya Kaabah."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Then called Yathrib: the city that welcomed the Prophet ﷺ. Its name means “the city”."
msgstr "Dahulu dikenali sebagai Yathrib: kota yang menyambut kedatangan Nabi ﷺ. Namanya bermaksud \"kota\"."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Abu Bakr"
msgstr "Abu Bakr"

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "The Prophet’s closest friend and companion, who later led the Muslims after him."
msgstr "Sahabat karib dan teman perjalanan Nabi, yang kemudiannya memimpin umat Islam selepas baginda wafat."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Allah"
msgstr "Allah"

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "The Arabic word for God."
msgstr "Perkataan bahasa Arab untuk Tuhan."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "The holy book of Islam, which Muslims believe is the word of Allah."
msgstr "Kitab suci umat Islam, yang diyakini oleh umat Islam sebagai kalam Allah."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "The collection of hadith that Muslims consider the most reliable."
msgstr "Himpunan hadis yang dianggap paling sahih oleh umat Islam."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Ibn Kathir"
msgstr "Ibn Kathir"

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "A scholar of the fourteenth century whose history of the Prophet’s life is widely used."
msgstr "Seorang ulama abad ke-14 yang karya sejarahnya mengenai kehidupan Nabi digunakan secara meluas."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Ibn Ishaq"
msgstr "Ibn Ishaq"

#: src/content/lenses.js
#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "Thawr"
msgstr "Thawr"

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "A mountain south of Makkah, with a small cave near its top."
msgstr "Sebuah gunung di selatan Makkah, dengan sebuah gua kecil berhampiran puncaknya."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "A village on the edge of Madinah, where the Prophet ﷺ stopped first."
msgstr "Sebuah perkampungan di pinggir Madinah, tempat pertama Nabi ﷺ berhenti."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "A passage of the Quran, the holy book of Islam."
msgstr "Satu ayat atau surah daripada Al-Quran, kitab suci umat Islam."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "A hadith: a report of the Prophet’s words or deeds, passed on through named narrators. The collections of al-Bukhari and Muslim are considered the most reliable."
msgstr "Hadis: laporan tentang kata-kata atau perbuatan Nabi, yang disampaikan melalui perawi yang dinamakan. Koleksi al-Bukhari dan Muslim dianggap paling sahih."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "A report from the early histories of the Prophet’s life. They gather many accounts, some stronger than others."
msgstr "Laporan daripada sejarah awal kehidupan Nabi. Ia mengumpulkan banyak riwayat, sesetengahnya lebih kuat berbanding yang lain."

#: src/content/lenses.js
#, ai
msgid "A modern author’s explanation or calculation, built on the early sources."
msgstr "Penjelasan atau pengiraan pengarang moden, yang dibina berdasarkan sumber-sumber awal."

