#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "Abu Bakr prepared two camels. Asma helped pack food for the journey."
msgstr "Abu Bakr menyediakan dua ekor unta. Asma membantu membungkus makanan untuk perjalanan."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "They chose a guide who knew the roads well. He would bring their camels after three nights."
msgstr "Mereka memilih seorang penunjuk jalan yang mahir selok-belok jalan. Dia akan membawa unta mereka selepas tiga malam."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "An early account tells how the leaders of Quraysh met in Makkah to plan against the Prophet ﷺ."
msgstr "Satu riwayat awal menceritakan bagaimana para pembesar Quraisy berkumpul di Makkah untuk merancang rancangan terhadap Nabi ﷺ."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "The account says they waited outside his door that night, while ‘Ali slept in his bed, wrapped in his green cloak."
msgstr "Riwayat itu menyebut mereka menunggu di luar pintu rumahnya pada malam itu, sementara ‘Ali tidur di atas tempat tidurnya berselimutkan kain hijaunya."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "After three nights, their guide brought the camels. They left the cave and travelled towards Madinah."
msgstr "Selepas tiga malam, penunjuk jalan membawa unta-unta tersebut. Mereka meninggalkan gua itu dan memulakan perjalanan menuju ke Madinah."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "They took a route near the coast. The journey was long, with many stops along the way."
msgstr "Mereka mengambil laluan berhampiran pantai. Perjalanan itu jauh, dengan banyak tempat berhenti di sepanjang jalan."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "Another account describes a stop at Umm Ma‘bad’s tent. She had a thin sheep that was not giving milk."
msgstr "Satu lagi riwayat menggambarkan persinggahan di khemah Umm Ma‘bad. Beliau mempunyai seekor kambing kurus yang tidak mengeluarkan susu."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "It says the Prophet ﷺ prayed and milked the sheep, and there was milk for everyone."
msgstr "Ia menyebut bahawa Nabi ﷺ berdoa dan memerah susu kambing itu, dan terdapat susu yang mencukupi untuk semua orang."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "They first stopped at Quba, near Madinah, where a mosque was founded."
msgstr "Mereka mula-mula berhenti di Quba, berhampiran Madinah, di mana sebuah masjid didirikan."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "Madinah is to the north. They went south first, towards Mount Thawr."
msgstr "Madinah terletak di sebelah utara. Mereka menuju ke selatan terlebih dahulu, ke arah Gunung Thawr."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "A mosque was founded at Quba, making worship a part of life in the new home."
msgstr "Sebuah masjid didirikan di Quba, menjadikan ibadah sebahagian daripada kehidupan di tempat baharu."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "Madinah became a home for the growing Muslim community, bringing newcomers and their hosts together."
msgstr "Madinah menjadi tempat kediaman bagi masyarakat Islam yang semakin berkembang, menyatukan pendatang baharu dan tuan rumah mereka."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "An eighth-century historian whose accounts of the Prophet’s life are preserved by later writers."
msgstr "Seorang ahli sejarah abad kelapan yang catatannya tentang kehidupan Nabi telah dipelihara oleh para penulis terkemudian."

#: src/routes/Journey.svelte
msgid "Mode changed. Your place is saved."
msgstr "Mod ditukar. Kedudukan anda disimpan."

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "‘Ali stayed behind to return the precious things that people had left with the Prophet ﷺ."
msgstr "‘Ali tinggal di belakang untuk memulangkan barang-barang berharga yang ditinggalkan orang ramai bersama Nabi ﷺ."

#: src/lib/scene-manifest.js
msgid "E09"
msgstr "E09"

#: src/content/lenses.js
msgid "In Madinah, Muslims went out to wait for the Prophet ﷺ. The arrival account tells how they welcomed him."
msgstr "Di Madinah, umat Islam keluar untuk menunggu Nabi ﷺ. Riwayat ketibaan menceritakan bagaimana mereka menyambut baginda."

